<title>AUSTRIA: Austria sells 15 bln ATS in 5.5 pct 6-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Austria sells 15 bln ATS in 5.5 pct 6-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced on Tuesday by Austrian Kontrollbank.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Austria</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 15 bln ATS</p>
<p>MATURITY: September 13, 2002</p>
<p>COUPON: 5.5 pct</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.52003 pct</p>
<p>MAXIMUM YIELD: 5.77 pct</p>
<p>BID/AMOUNT COVER: 68.2048 pct</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
